<title>USA: BASEBALL-RESULTS OF PLAYOFF GAMES ON SATURDAY.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-RESULTS OF PLAYOFF GAMES ON SATURDAY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Major League</p>
<p>Baseball division series playoff games on Saturday (home team</p>
<p>in CAPS):</p>
<p>	    American League</p>
<p> New York	  6	TEXAS	 4</p>
<p>(New York wins the best-of-five-games series 3-1)</p>
<p> Baltimore	 4	CLEVELAND   3 (12 innings)</p>
<p>(Baltimore wins best-of-five series 3-1)</p>
<p>	    National League</p>
<p> St Louis	  7	SAN DIEGO   5</p>
<p>(St Louis wins best-of-five-games series 3-0)</p>
<p> ATLANTA	    5   Los Angeles    2</p>
<p>(Atlanta wins best-of-five-games series 3-0)</p>
</text>
